    statusTag: DEADBOLTED
    threatLevel: SAFE (SEALED)
    scavengeStatus: KEYS LOCKED INSIDE
    acousticScan: MUTED TV STATIC
    reconIntel: Your residential apartment. The heavy deadbolt clicked shut automatically when you stepped out into the hallway. In your panic to pack, your keys were left sitting on the kitchen counter. There's no getting back inside without making enough noise to wake the dead.
    connectedRoomIds:
    - hallway_1
