    undiscoveredSub: UPPER HALL
    undiscoveredTitle: NORTH CORRIDOR // UPPER HALLWAY
    statusTag: DIM LIGHTING
    threatLevel: LOW
    scavengeStatus: SCATTERED SHOES
    acousticScan: FAINT DRAFT
    reconIntel: The north corridor segment outside your door (407) and Professor Harmon's (406). Emergency backup bulbs cast jittery amber shadows over the worn carpet. Scattered slippers and dropped mail show how fast people ran.
    connectedRoomIds:
    - unit_407
    - unit_406
    - hallway_2
