    undiscoveredSub: PROF. HARMON
    undiscoveredTitle: UNIT 406 // PROFESSOR HARMON'S PLACE
    statusTag: KEYPAD LOCKED
    threatLevel: QUIET / NO SOUND
    scavengeStatus: SURVIVAL NOTES & FOOD
    acousticScan: FAINT KEYPAD HUM
    reconIntel: Professor Harmon's apartment. An eccentric sociology professor who spent years writing about societal collapse. He posted his keypad code (8445) before the cell towers died, telling neighbors to take whatever supplies they need.
    connectedRoomIds:
    - hallway_1
  - roomId: unit_405
    roomCode: UNIT 405
    shortSub: MARCUS
    fullTitle: UNIT 405 // MARCUS'S APARTMENT
    position: {x: 58.3, y: 59.7}
    size: {x: 35.1, y: 35.1}
