    isAccessible: 1
    isDiscovered: 0
    undiscoveredSub: MARCUS
    undiscoveredTitle: UNIT 405 // MARCUS'S APARTMENT
    statusTag: DOOR AJAR (TRIPPED?)
    threatLevel: TRIPWIRE HAZARD
    scavengeStatus: GUNPOWDER & SAFE
    acousticScan: METALLIC CLINK
    reconIntel: Marcus's place. The quiet veteran down the hall who always talked about home defense and bugging out. The door is cracked open an inch and smells sharply of gun oil and cordite—knowing Marcus, he didn't leave without booby-trapping the entrance.
    connectedRoomIds:
    - hallway_2
  - roomId: hallway_2
    roomCode: HALLWAY 2
    shortSub: MID-HALL
    fullTitle: MID-HALLWAY // SECTION 2
    position: {x: 0.0, y: 59.7}
