    statusTag: FAINT CORDITE
    threatLevel: MEDIUM
    scavengeStatus: OVERTURNED TABLES
    acousticScan: DOG BARKING & SCRATCHING
    reconIntel: The middle hallway corridor between Mrs. Gable's barricaded unit (404) and Marcus's apartment (405). The carpet is kicked up and smells faintly of spent powder. Buster's frantic whines echo through the walls.
    connectedRoomIds:
    - hallway_1
    - unit_405
    - unit_404
    - hallway_3
  - roomId: unit_404
    roomCode: UNIT 404
    shortSub: MRS. GABLE
    fullTitle: UNIT 404 // MRS. GABLE & BUSTER
    position: {x: -58.3, y: 59.7}
