    undiscoveredSub: MRS. GABLE
    undiscoveredTitle: UNIT 404 // MRS. GABLE & BUSTER
    statusTag: FURNITURE WEDGED
    threatLevel: PANICKED RESIDENT
    scavengeStatus: NONE / KEEP OUT
    acousticScan: DOG SCRATCHING & WHINING
    reconIntel: Old Mrs. Gable's place. Sweet old lady who always gave out hard candies in the elevator. She panics at every loud siren—she must have shoved her heavy oak dresser against the door when the screaming started. Her golden retriever Buster is whining and scratching frantically at the wood.
    connectedRoomIds:
    - hallway_2
  - roomId: unit_403
    roomCode: UNIT 403
    shortSub: SARAH (AWAY)
    fullTitle: UNIT 403 // SARAH'S APARTMENT
    position: {x: 58.3, y: 0.0}
    size: {x: 35.1, y: 35.1}
