    isAccessible: 0
    isDiscovered: 0
    undiscoveredSub: SARAH (AWAY)
    undiscoveredTitle: UNIT 403 // SARAH'S APARTMENT
    statusTag: LOCKED / VACANT
    threatLevel: NO SIGN OF LIFE
    scavengeStatus: NONE / VACANT
    acousticScan: DEAD SILENCE
    reconIntel: Sarah's apartment. She's an ER trauma nurse down at Swedish Medical. Her running sneakers aren't on the welcome mat and the apartment is pitch black. She was on the night shift when the hospitals were overwhelmed—she never made it back home.
    connectedRoomIds:
    - hallway_3
