    statusTag: PITCH BLACK
    threatLevel: MEDIUM
    scavengeStatus: UNSEARCHED
    acousticScan: DISTANT CHOPIN PIANO
    reconIntel: The ceiling fixtures have completely burned out in this section. The hallway is pitch black except for a thin sliver of warm light beneath the Andersons' chained door, accompanied by haunting piano music.
