    scavengeStatus: MEDICINE & SUPP.
    acousticScan: CHOPIN ON VINYL
    reconIntel: The Andersons' place. The polite family from down the hall whose daughter Emma plays classical piano. The door is cracked two inches on a brass security chain. The smell of harsh bleach seeps out, while Chopin's Nocturne plays softly on repeat from their living room.
