    statusTag: DOOR WIDE OPEN
    threatLevel: BLARING NOISE
    scavengeStatus: CAR KEYS & RATIONS
    acousticScan: BLARING POP MUSIC
    reconIntel: The corner apartment rented to college students. They were throwing a massive weekend party when the sirens started. The front door was left hanging wide open during the stampede. Obnoxious pop music is still thumping from their sound system, drowning out the street.
